  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '1. In the early game, select all units (CTRL+A) and issue an AttackMoveToPosition
    command (A+Right Click) to push towards the enemy''s expected location and gain
    map

    control.

    2. Prioritize base defense by assigning DDG51 destroyers
    to a defensive patrol around Rig Balder (e.g., F1 + Move command) to intercept
    incoming threats.

    3. Actively use JariUSV units (F2 + Move command) to scout
    enemy quadrants, locate the enemy base, and identify high-value targets, then
    direct combat units to engage.

    4. Practice using AttackMoveToEntity (A+Right
    Click on an enemy unit) to focus fire on individual enemy units, maximizing damage
    dealt and preserving your own units.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
